ExteriorIdeals -- a package for working with ideals over exterior algebra
*************************************************************************

Description
===========

ExteriorIdeals is a package for creating and manipulating ideals over exterior
algebra

Acknowledgement
===============

The method *note isLexIdeal: isLexIdeal, was taken from *note isLexIdeal:
(LexIdeals)isLexIdeal, in Chris Francisco's package *note LexIdeals:
(LexIdeals)Top,.

Authors
=======

  * Marilena Crupi (see http://www.unime.it/it/persona/marilena-crupi )
    <mcrupi@unime.it>
  * Luca Amata (see http://mat521.unime.it/amata ) <lamata@unime.it>

Certification a gold star
=========================

Version 1.0 of this package was accepted for publication in volume 8 (see
https://msp.org/jsag/2018/8-1/ ) of The Journal of Software for Algebra and
Geometry (see https://msp.org/jsag/ ) on 24 June 2018, in the article
ExteriorIdeals: a package for computing monomial ideals in an exterior algebra
(see https://msp.org/jsag/2018/8-1/p07.xhtml ) (DOI: 10.2140/jsag.2018.8.71
(see https://doi.org/10.2140/jsag.2018.8.71 )). That version can be obtained
from the journal (see https://msp.org/jsag/2018/8-1/jsag-v8-n1-x07-
ExteriorIdeals.m2 ).

