Shift -- optional argument for macaulayExpansion
************************************************

Description
===========

Whether it is true the function macaulayExpansion gives the i-th shifted
Macaulay expansion of a. Given a pair of positive integers (a,i) the i-th
shifted Macaulay expansion is a sum of binomials:  binomial(a_i,i+1) +
binomial(a_{i-1},i) + ... + binomial(a_j,j+1).

See also
========

  * *note macaulayExpansion: macaulayExpansion, -- compute the Macaulay
    expansion of a positive integer

Functions with optional argument named Shift:
=============================================

  * "macaulayExpansion(...,Shift=>...)"

