solveMacaulayExpansion -- compute the sum of a Macaulay expansion
*****************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        solveMacaulayExpansion l
  * Inputs:
      * l, a list of pairs of natural numbers representing a Macaulay expansion
  * Outputs:
      * an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, representing the sum of binomials
        in the listl

Description
===========

Given a list of pairs {{a_1,b_1}, ... ,{a_k,b_k}} this method yields the sum of
binomials  binomial(a_1,b_1) + ... + binomial(a_k,b_k).

Example:

+------------------------------------------+
|i1 : solveMacaulayExpansion({{4,2},{3,1}})|
|                                          |
|o1 = 9                                    |
+------------------------------------------+

